Contains information about a property value to retrieve from the protocol. The WTS_PROPERTY_VALUE structure is used by the QueryProperty method.
Syntax
typedef struct __WTS_PROPERTY_VALUE {
unsigned short Type;
union {
ULONG ulVal;
struct {
ULONG size;
WCHAR *pstrVal;
} strVal;
struct {
ULONG size;
char *pbVal;
} bVal;
GUID guidVal;
} u;
} __WTS_PROPERTY_VALUE, WTS_PROPERTY_VALUE, *PWTS_PROPERTY_VALUE, __WRDS_PROPERTY_VALUE;
Members
Type
An integer that specifies which member of the union contains the property value information. This can be one of the following values.
VALUE_TYPE_ULONG
The value is contained in the ulVal member.
VALUE_TYPE_STRING
The value is contained in the strVal member.
VALUE_TYPE_BINARY
The value is contained in the bVal member.
VALUE_TYPE_GUID
